factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The reel_script says the incident took place in Venthanpatti (வேந்தன்பட்டி) 'இன்று நவம்பர் 19ஆம் தேதி'; the article only says Chenna bus owner was from Venthanpatti near Ponnamaravathi and gives the date as today (நவ.19), so the location of the killing is not explicitly stated, but the headline and slides also assert the killing occurred in Venthanpatti, which the article does not clearly state (it says 'பொன்னமராவதி அருகே').
  The reel_script states Chidambaram was 'சென்னையில் தனியார் ஆம்னி பஸ் நிறுவனம் நடத்தி வந்த' and that he came to his hometown for a relative's wedding; the article says he was staying at his home with family and the wedding was of a relative's house, so the sentence 'உறவினர் வீட்டுத் திருமண விழாவுக்காக சொந்த ஊரான வேந்தன்பட்டிக்கு வந்திருந்தார்' is acceptable, but the reel_script omits that he was staying with his family at home.
  The reel_script says the dispute arose while discussing the marriage hall (திருமண மண்டபத்தை ஊராரிடம் ஒப்படைப்பது குறித்து) without noting that the article describes it as a private marriage hall, which is a minor omission rather than an error.
  The slides_spec line 'சிதம்பரம் சென்னையில் தனியார் ஆம்னி பஸ் நிறுவனம் நடத்தி' is an incomplete, ungrammatical sentence with no clear meaning in Tamil.
  The slides_spec 'இருவரிடமும் விசாரணை நடைபெறுகிறது' and 'வழக்கு விசாரணை தொடர்கிறது' add a general claim that the case investigation continues; the article only says police are arresting and interrogating the two, so the slide repeats this with a slightly different framing (a second 'investigation continues' claim) that is not stated as a separate fact.
  The caption states the incident happened in 'வேந்தன்பட்டியில' while the article only says 'பொன்னமராவதி அருகே வேந்தன்பட்டியை சேர்ந்தவர்' referring to the victim's home village, not the scene of the crime; the article never says the killing happened in Venthanpatti.
